## Resilience and mirrors

To ensure long-term availability, this project is mirrored and archived across multiple platforms:

- Canonical: https://github.com/jellybabypsi/system7.1
- Mirrors: https://gitlab.com/<org>/<repo> • https://codeberg.org/<org>/<repo> • https://bitbucket.org/<org>/<repo>
- Archives (per release): Zenodo (DOI), Software Heritage, Internet Archive
- Checksums and signatures: see Releases assets (SHA256, GPG)

Why mirrors? To keep science, safety, and community tools available even if any single host is targeted or offline. Signed releases and checksums verify integrity.

